    "title": "About",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Final-year engineering student at EPITA, Image major. I build complete image pipelines, from the Python prototype to the CUDA port: illustration detection with the BnF, licence plate reading without deep learning, motion detection 24 times faster on GPU.",
